  r1,"nearest-wins-scalim-yaml-yields-discovery-payload",某 `YAML` 文件位于项目子目录，且父目录链上存在 `scalim.yaml`,editor 调用 project discovery,返回的 `project_root` MUST 为最近的 `scalim.yaml` 所在目录
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"diagnostics-are-computed-without-spawning-a-subprocess","",editor 请求某 YAML 的 diagnostics,系统 MUST 返回结构化 diagnostics（errors/warnings + path + range）
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"resolving-definitions-does-not-mutate-process-globals","editor 触发 go-to-definition",core 解析某 Python 引用,解析过程 MUST NOT 改写进程级全局搜索路径
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"definition-resolution-locates-a-python-function","YAML 中某字段引用 `pkg.mod:func`","用户触发 go-to-definition",系统 MUST 返回 `func` 定义所在文件与范围
  r4,"relative-module-definition-resolution-locates-a-python-funct",YAML 文件位于某个 `python_roots` 之下,"用户触发 go-to-definition 且 core 收到 `yaml_path + python_roots`",系统 MUST 将 `.loaders` 规范化为绝对模块路径
  r4,"relative-module-resolution-degrades-when-base-cannot-be-deri",YAML 文件不在任何 `python_roots` 条目下,"用户触发 go-to-definition",系统 MUST 返回空 locations
  r4,"object-method-resolution-locates-class-method-and-returns-fa",Python 模块 `pkg.mod` 内存在 `class Klass` 且其定义 `def a_method(self)`（可调用实现）,"YAML 中某字段引用 `pkg.mod:some_ref.a_method`",definition MUST 返回至少 2 个 locations
  r4,"object-method-resolution-follows-simple-imports",Python 模块 `pkg.mod` 内存在 `from pkg.other import Klass`,"YAML 中某字段引用 `pkg.mod:some_ref.a_method`",第一个 location MUST 指向 `pkg.other.Klass.a_method` 的定义位置
  r4,"object-method-resolution-follows-imported-object-single-hop",Python 模块 `pkg.mod` 内存在 `from pkg.other import some_ref`,"YAML 中某字段引用 `pkg.mod:some_ref.a_method`",definition MUST 返回至少 3 个 locations
  r4,"object-method-resolution-degrades-when-class-cannot-be-infer",Python 模块 `pkg.mod` 内存在 `some_ref = factory()`（返回类型未知）,"YAML 中某字段引用 `pkg.mod:some_ref.a_method`",definition MUST NOT crash
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"cursor-inside-a-scalar-string-yields-extracted-reference-ran","某 demand YAML 包含 `loader: \"pkg.mod:func\"` 且光标位于该字符串值内部",editor semantics core 执行光标抽取,MUST 返回 `yaml_path` 指向该字段
  r5,"cursor-inside-a-block-scalar-yields-extracted-reference-rang","某 demand YAML 包含： `call_by: |` ` pkg.mod:fn(a=1)`","光标位于 `pkg.mod:fn` 区间并触发抽取","MUST 返回 `reference` 等于 `pkg.mod:fn`"
  r5,"call-by-reference-with-args-yields-head-reference","某 demand YAML 包含 `call_by: \"pkg.mod:fn(a=1)\"` 且光标位于 `pkg.mod:fn` 区间",editor semantics core 执行光标抽取,"MUST 返回 `reference` 等于 `pkg.mod:fn`"
  r5,"parse-failure-degrades-to-empty-result-with-warnings",某 YAML 语法不完整或无法被解析,editor semantics core 执行光标抽取,MUST 返回空结果
  r6,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r6,"cursor-on-kwargs-value-token-yields-extracted-field-referenc","YAML 包含 `call_by: \"pkg.mod:fn(x=a)\"`",光标位于 `a` 上并触发 hover/definition,抽取结果 MUST 将 token `a` 解析为字段引用
  r6,"cursor-on-kwargs-value-token-in-multiline-call-by-yields-ext","YAML 包含： `call_by: |` ` pkg.mod:fn(` ` x=a, # comment` ` )`",光标位于 `a` 上并触发 hover/definition,抽取结果 MUST 将 token `a` 解析为字段引用
  r6,"cursor-on-kwargs-name-yields-empty-field-extraction","YAML 包含 `call_by: \"pkg.mod:fn(x=a)\"`",光标位于 `x` 上并触发 hover/definition,系统 MUST NOT 将 `x` 解析为字段引用
  r7,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r7,"compute-expression-token-resolves-to-field-definition","YAML 声明 `fields.a: ...` 且存在 `fields.sum.compute: \\\"a + 1\\\"`",光标位于表达式中的 token `a` 上并触发 definition/hover,token MUST 解析为对 `fields.a` 的引用